ble themes and each theme comes in 2 variants; mix and match to try different combos\r\n<br>\r\n• 2 Rares + 2 Foil Lands in Every Pack—Every pack contains 1 thematic Rare card designed specifically for Jumpstart Boosters, 1 Rare or Mythic Rare from The Lord of the Rings: Tales of Middle-earth main set, and 2 Land cards with a shiny Traditional Foil treatment\r\n<br>\r\n• Contents—18 The Lord of the Rings: Tales of Middle-earth Jumpstart Boosters, with 20 MTG cards in each booster, including all the Lands you need to play"},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166205106"}]},{"productId":484916,"name":"Universes Beyond: The Lord of the Rings: Tales of Middle-earth - Jumpstart Booster Box Case","cleanName":"Universes Beyond The Lord of the Rings Tales of Middle earth Jumpstart Booster Box Case","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/484916_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":23019,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/484916/magic-universes-beyond-the-lord-of-the-rings-tales-of-middle-earth-universes-beyond-the-lord-of-the-rings-tales-of-middle-earth-jumpstart-booster-box-case","modifiedOn":"2023-06-23T04:04:40.82","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2023-06-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Each case contains 6 Universes Beyond: The Lord of the Rings: Tales of Middle-earth Jumpstart Booster Boxes."},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166205106"}]},{"productId":484917,"name":"Universes Beyond: The Lord of the Rings: Tales of Middle-earth - Bundle","cleanName":"Universes Beyond The Lord of the Rings Tales of Middle earth Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/484917_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":23019,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/484917/magic-universes-beyond-the-lord-of-the-rings-tales-of-middle-earth-universes-beyond-the-lord-of-the-rings-tales-of-middle-earth-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-11-